<title>MEXICO: Mexico TIIE 28-day rate falls to 25.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico TIIE 28-day rate falls to 25.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate (TIIE) fell to 25.11 percent Wednesday from 25.30 percent Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>TIIE, a market-weighted average interbank rate, is revised daily.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
